l7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"IGna30iAQJa6RMbsv-9tWg","review_id":"3GN2t-z030UbNSaCxJEIpA","date":"2021-02-07T18:17:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9464788436889648,"text_excerpt":"I LOVE Dong Phuong. Every time we head back home from Mississippi, we make a point to stop here. I haven't actually eaten in the restaurant so I can't attest to that, but everything else I have had from them is 5 stars. I do want to try their pho next door at the restaurant - that's on the list. Their king cake is highly coveted and always delicious. The real hidden treasures though are in the small little bake shop where you can get steamed baos, various Vietnamese pastries, and banh mi's. With covid, they limit the amount of people in there and do require social distancing from other parties. If you're getting a banh mi you order inside and pay, then wait outside and they bring it to yo..."},{"business_id":"IGna30iAQJa6RMbsv-9tWg","review_id":"N5NII2HcLosuWmnIT1UYlQ","date":"2021-01-17T22:41:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9417344331741333,"text_excerpt":"I preordered my Dong Phuong king cake back in December for pickup yesterday just so we could also get lunch while we were out there. It's been at least 5 years since I've eaten there so it was overdue! We were seated social distanced from other tables and the workers all had masks on. I got my usual hot tea, pho tai, and an order of pork eggrolls to split with my SO. The pork eggrolls were as good as I remember with their tasty dipping sauce. Then came my favorite part of eating at DP...the steaming hot bowl of pho with a full plate of add-ins. All my goodies added with a little sriracha and hoisin and I was ready to dig in. I'm a bit clumsy with chopsticks but powered through and enjoyed..."},{"business_id":"IGna30iAQJa6RMbsv-9tWg","review_id":"ZGq3yOEnrVT8sy588L5rcw","date":"2019-05-14T14:30:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9360771179199219,"text_excerpt":"Wow! While it's really out there in the East, it just might be worth the drive! For someone that works out here, it is a must for lunch. I love their grilled pork bahn mi and their pho, not to mention the lunch specials to die for! It is so full of flavor and affordable. The pork bun from the bakery is melt in your mouth. Every time I go I just can't wait until I'll be back again! The bahn mi is just served in a line in the bakery attached to the restaurant and you can sit outside or at the restaurant, though they will not bring you water or anything unless you are actually customers at the restaurant (bahn mi doesnt count), so bring your own water in! The king cake was AMAZING, though yo..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"IGna30iAQJa6RMbsv-9tWg","photo_id":"kn3htfa2onL0r4OMl1r42Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/kn3htfa2onL0r4OMl1r42Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7909700274467468},{"business_id":"IGna30iAQJa6RMbsv-9tWg","photo_id":"y0I-GhIMCH7ItQbXB62S6g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/y0I-GhIMCH7ItQbXB62S6g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7769153714179993},{"business_id":"IGna30iAQJa6RMbsv-9tWg","photo_id":"luLNVNTmA82g5-3tWVvI0A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/luLNVNTmA82g5-3tWVvI0A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7608492970466614},{"business_id":"IGna30iAQJa6RMbsv-9tWg","photo_id":"e5A1eq4TfcHCbbBmHnmrqw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/e5A1eq4TfcHCbbBmHnmrqw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7391237020492554},{"business_id":"IGna30iAQJa6RMbsv-9tWg","photo_id":"6S1D02VAkPesE_3T2Oy6oA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6S1D02VAkPesE_3T2Oy6oA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7132860422134399}]},"notebook_case":null}
